			"Message": "build(Project): Coordinate Element submodule updates across 4 components\n\nSynchronize Mountain, Output, Sky, and Wind submodules with the following changes:\n- **Mountain:** Fix extension location URI marshalling for VS Code renderer — VS Code's URI revival ignores objects without `$mid === 1` marker. Add Normalize_Location_To_UriComponents, Stamp_Mid_Uri, and Parse_File_Url_To_UriComponents functions to properly format extension locations. Extend BuildInitialUrl to recognize Mountain's `{uri:\"file://…\"}` format alongside VS Code's historical folderUri/workspace.configPath shapes for backward compatibility.\n- **Output:** Document CopyNodeModules-StripDanglingSourceMap pairing rationale explaining why they're expressed as separate plugins with role-scoped matching rather than using AfterCopy hook.\n- **Sky:** Delegate build pipeline to Output plugins (Steps 1-7, 10-12, 14) via reusable plugin system. Move phase advancement from Astro script block into workbench.js to prevent chunk hoisting from delaying phase advances past Mountain's fallback timers. Remove ext-registry-probe as it's noisy (monacoExtensionsApi not on globalThis). Gate missing browser bundle warnings behind LAND_WARN_MISSING_BROWSER_BUNDLES env var.\n- **Wind:** Complete polyfill re-export migration — Target/Polyfills/* files are now minimal re-export proxies delegating to @codeeditorland/output/Polyfill/* implementations.\n\nThis coordinated update delivers extension sidebar location resolution, build pipeline modularity, and polyfill consolidation while maintaining identical runtime behavior.",
