				5
			],
			"Message": "build(Project): Coordinate Element submodule updates across 5 components\n\nSynchronize Cocoon, Mountain, Output, Sky, and Wind submodules with the following changes:\n\n- **Mountain:** Initialize PostHog telemetry at boot before CLI parsing to capture early crash context. Fix incorrect #[tauri::command] attribute on internal dispatcher with clarifying docstring. Restore recently opened folder via BuildInitialUrl reading RecentlyOpened.json and passing ?folder=<path> to skip Welcome → Open Folder → hard reload round-trip (fixes purple splash flash, stuttering, empty @builtin sidebar, broken keybindings from double layer boot). Fix macOS window dragging by replacing maximized(true) with TitleBarStyle::Overlay + hidden_title(true) (keeps traffic lights visible, allows VS Code custom titlebar drag). Normalize en-dashes to hyphens in documentation.\n\n- **Sky:** Eliminate early paint flash by adding inline CSS in <head> matching VS Code Dark+ (#1e1e1e background, #d4d4d4 text). Add client-side PostHog throttling with 10s window and 2×/sec per-event limit, reporting dropped events as land:sky:throttle-dropped. Fix lifecycle phase signaling by moving phase 3→4 advancement to separate <script> before workbench import, fixing Tauri invoke signature from mountain_ipc_invoke to MountainIPCInvoke (previously caused silent deserialization failures). Adjust timing: phase 3 immediate, phase 4 at 1500ms.\n\n- **Wind:** Route all colon-prefixed IPC methods (file:read, file:write, shared_process:invoke) through MountainIPCInvoke to work around Rust function name limitations. Update TauriIPC.ts to use consistent PascalCase \"MountainIPCInvoke\" instead of snake-case. Fix em dashes to hyphens in LifecycleService and PostHog/Fallback comments.\n\n- **Output:** Route colon-prefixed Tauri commands in polyfills (ChildProcessPolyfill, FileProtocolShim, FileSystemPolyfill, IPCRendererShim, NativeModulePolyfill, ProcessPolyfill, SharedProcessProxy) through MountainIPCInvoke. Update sendTauri in IPCRendererShim for consistency.\n\n- **Cocoon:** Submodule updated to a5ec2e6d.\n\nThis coordinated update delivers recently opened folder restoration, macOS window drag fixes, IPC routing consistency, and early paint flash elimination while maintaining identical runtime behavior.",
